  m_Name: GoodMorning
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: ShadowWorkshop.Runtime::CloudGarden.ShadowPuzzle.Torch2Level
  title: G O O D   M O R N I N G
  button: GOOD MORNING
  riddle: A pan, an egg, strawberries, cheese, a spatula, a whisk, a ladle and two
    forks. Someone is up before you.
  hint: Lean the pile back and keep turning. The pan is a body, the egg a head, the
    utensils fan out as a tail and the forks stand like feet.
  complete: 'GOOD MORNING

    Cock-a-doodle-doo.'
  accent: {r: 0.98, g: 0.55, b: 0.3, a: 1}
  lamps: 00000000
